ompute\n\n$$\n{A}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nwhich gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{T}+A & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, compute the gradient at $x=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{x}f(x) & =({A}^{T}+A)x \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-4-3 \\\\ 3+4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-7 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-6620062e-023f-5c7d-9835-fb1b352d0fc1" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-3996e568-037c-55af-9d58-338cfb32e23d" :answer-field/id #uuid "3996e568-037c-55af-9d58-338cfb32e23d"] ["answer-39c82852-558e-54b0-9642-2d3f9d763221" :answer/id #uuid "39c82852-558e-54b0-9642-2d3f9d763221"] ["answer-39c82852-558e-54b0-9642-2d3f9d763221" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-39c82852-558e-54b0-9642-2d3f9d763221" :answer/value "-7"] ["answer-field-3996e568-037c-55af-9d58-338cfb32e23d" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-3996e568-037c-55af-9d58-338cfb32e23d" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-3996e568-037c-55af-9d58-338cfb32e23d" :answer-field/correct "answer-39c82852-558e-54b0-9642-2d3f9d763221"] ["answer-field-3996e568-037c-55af-9d58-338cfb32e23d" :answer-field/choices "answer-39c82852-558e-54b0-9642-2d3f9d763221"] ["answer-field-32739e0b-ce49-5335-90d2-32e863e2de3f" :answer-field/id #uuid "32739e0b-ce49-5335-90d2-32e863e2de3f"] ["answer-a2f41369-88fc-57d9-9f6c-32363ff7bcbc" :answer/id #uuid "a2f41369-88fc-57d9-9f6c-32363ff7bcbc"] ["answer-a2f41369-88fc-57d9-9f6c-32363ff7bcbc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-a2f41369-88fc-57d9-9f6c-32363ff7bcbc" :answer/value "7"] ["answer-field-32739e0b-ce49-5335-90d2-32e863e2de3f" :answer-field/key "field-2"] ["answer-field-32739e0b-ce49-5335-90d2-32e863e2de3f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-32739e0b-ce49-5335-90d2-32e863e2de3f" :answer-field/correct "answer-a2f41369-88fc-57d9-9f6c-32363ff7bcbc"] ["answer-field-32739e0b-ce49-5335-90d2-32e863e2de3f" :answer-field/choices "answer-a2f41369-88fc-57d9-9f6c-32363ff7bcbc"] ["question-6620062e-023f-5c7d-9835-fb1b352d0fc1" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-3996e568-037c-55af-9d58-338cfb32e23d"] ["question-6620062e-023f-5c7d-9835-fb1b352d0fc1" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-32739e0b-ce49-5335-90d2-32e863e2de3f"] [17592186208847 :knowledge-point/questions "question-6620062e-023f-5c7d-9835-fb1b352d0fc1"] ["question-a1a89719-12d3-55da-8498-af0dfd930411" :question/id #uuid "a1a89719-12d3-55da-8498-af0dfd930411"] ["question-a1a89719-12d3-55da-8498-af0dfd930411" :question/math-academy-id "q-276045"] ["question-a1a89719-12d3-55da-8498-af0dfd930411" :question/problem "Compute the gradient of the function $f:{R}^{2}\\to R$ defined by\n\n$$\nf(x)={x}^{T}[\\begin{aligned}3 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]x\n$$\n\nwith respect to $x$ at  $x={[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2\\end{aligned}]}^{T}.$\n\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"70px\" rowspan=\"3\" width=\"30px\">$\\,{∇}_{x}f=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"35px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"35px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>"] ["question-a1a89719-12d3-55da-8498-af0dfd930411" :question/worked-solution "Defining the matrix $A$ as\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nwe have $f(x)={x}^{T}Ax.$\n\nSince $A$ is not symmetric, we use the more general formula for the gradient of a quadratic function:\n\n$$\n{∇}_{x}f(x)=({A}^{T}+A)x\n$$\n\nFirst, we compute\n\n$$\n{A}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 1\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nwhich gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{T}+A & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 1\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}3 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}6 & -4 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, compute the gradient at $x=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{x}f(x) & =({A}^{T}+A)x \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}6 & -4 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}6-8 \\\\ -4+4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-a1a89719-12d3-55da-8498-af0dfd930411" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-5e2ac6c8-308e-5ccb-b6d7-b77764401e1c" :answer-field/id #uuid "5e2ac6c8-308e-5ccb-b6d7-b77764401e1c"] ["answer-227e2fbf-1d08-52e2-8bba-7c210918adda" :answer/id #uuid "227e2fbf-1d08-52e2-8bba-7c210918adda"] ["answer-227e2fbf-1d08-52e2-8bba-7c210918adda" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-227e2fbf-1d08-52e2-8bba-7c210918adda" :answer/value "-2"] ["answer-field-5e2ac6c8-308e-5ccb-b6d7-b77764401e1c" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-5e2ac6c8-308e-5ccb-b6d7-b77764401e1c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-5e2ac6c8-308e-5ccb-b6d7-b77764401e1c" :answer-field/correct "answer-227e2fbf-1d08-52e2-8bba-7c210918adda"] ["answer-field-5e2ac6c8-308e-5ccb-b6d7-b77764401e1c" :answer-field/choices "answer-227e2fbf-1d08-52e2-8bba-7c210918adda"] ["answer-field-6a3d4772-d0cb-5d4d-8e1f-b23b20b49b43" :answer-field/id #uuid "6a3d4772-d0cb-5d4d-8e1f-b23b20b49b43"] ["answer-a9a795b8-272f-565d-b750-ab45ec83143c" :answer/id #uuid "a9a795b8-272f-565d-b750-ab45ec83143c"] ["answer-a9a795b8-272f-565d-b750-ab45ec83143c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-a9a795b8-272f-565d-b750-ab45ec83143c" :answer/value "0"] ["answer-field-6a3d4772-d0cb-5d4d-8e1f-b23b20b49b43" :answer-field/key "field-2"] ["answer-field-6a3d4772-d0cb