se the more general formula for the gradient of a quadratic function:\n\n$$\n{∇}_{x}f(x)=({A}^{T}+A)x\n$$\n\nFirst, we compute\n\n$$\n{A}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nwhich gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{T}+A & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, compute the gradient at $x=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{x}f(x) & =({A}^{T}+A)x \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2+1+1 \\\\ 1+2-2 \\\\ 1-2+2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-4ab946d8-2af3-5f4a-a52a-5bbd914240e1" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-9b4eb1e8-7e8f-56fe-9cc5-7c0534c2be46" :answer-field/id #uuid "9b4eb1e8-7e8f-56fe-9cc5-7c0534c2be46"] ["answer-6989e33b-e0ac-5a5c-a634-fca03e458f20" :answer/id #uuid "6989e33b-e0ac-5a5c-a634-fca03e458f20"] ["answer-6989e33b-e0ac-5a5c-a634-fca03e458f20" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6989e33b-e0ac-5a5c-a634-fca03e458f20" :answer/value "0"] ["answer-field-9b4eb1e8-7e8f-56fe-9cc5-7c0534c2be46" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-9b4eb1e8-7e8f-56fe-9cc5-7c0534c2be46" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-9b4eb1e8-7e8f-56fe-9cc5-7c0534c2be46" :answer-field/correct "answer-6989e33b-e0ac-5a5c-a634-fca03e458f20"] ["answer-field-9b4eb1e8-7e8f-56fe-9cc5-7c0534c2be46" :answer-field/choices "answer-6989e33b-e0ac-5a5c-a634-fca03e458f20"] ["answer-field-902e36f6-38d1-549f-a1dc-9a28e448d787" :answer-field/id #uuid "902e36f6-38d1-549f-a1dc-9a28e448d787"] ["answer-05c026ae-ac1c-53eb-98c4-1750389eab42" :answer